---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this license
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
The MIT license above covers the source code, the documents and the log files
written by this project (everything tracked in this repository).

It does NOT cover, and does not grant any rights to, the game
"Age of Empires II: HD Edition" or any of its assets. This repository contains
no game data: no *.drs archive, no executable, and no extracted game script.
It only contains our own tooling plus the evidence logs listed in
docs/FILE_MAP.md. Some of those logs quote short excerpts of the retail AI
scripts (rule text) for the purpose of documenting the bug and its fix; those
excerpts remain the property of their respective rights holders and are
included for interoperability and documentation only.

To use the tools you must own a legitimate copy of the game; the tools only
read and write the *.drs files of your own local installation. Because a
patched archive is a modified game asset, restore the original files with
`python dm_restore.py` before playing on-line.
